[center][size=6][b][color=#12a3b4]AN76 Toilets[/color][/b][/size]
[size=4]Your bladder has opinions. So does everyone else's.[/size][/center]

In Advanced Needs 76, your character needs the bathroom. This add-on makes it part of the game: funny sounds and voices, accidents if you hold it too long, and toilets and urinals all over the Commonwealth that you can finally use. NPCs use them too. It is an add-on for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/58440]Advanced Needs 76[/url]'s bathroom needs.

[size=5][b][color=#12a3b4]In short[/color][/b][/size]

[b]What you get[/b]
[list]
[*]Funny bathroom sounds and voices, plus a HUD icon that warns you: yellow, orange, red.[/*]
[*]Accidents if you wait too long, and the mess they leave behind.[/*]
[*]The game's own toilets and urinals work, and settlers and companions use them too.[/*]
[*]Bonus: the world's stoves and espresso machines work like AN76's.[/*]
[/list][b]What you need[/b]: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/58440]Advanced Needs 76[/url], [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/20309]HUDFramework[/url], F4SE and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/21497]Mod Configuration Menu[/url] (MCM, for the settings).
[b]How it goes[/b]: install with Vortex or MO2. The installer checks your setup first. See [b]Requirements[/b], below.

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/accidents.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Accidents.[/b] Hold it until the clock turns red and nature wins: the conversation ends, the street cowers, screams and gags, and the aftermath lingers.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/npcs.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Everyone goes.[/b] Settlers and companions sit down, undress, go, and dress again: on the game's own toilets, AN76's, and ours. Children keep their clothes on.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/voices.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Every voice joins in.[/b] 8,110 voice files across all 540 vanilla voices, and a 61-clip soundboard in a man's and a woman's version.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/world.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]The world's toilets work.[/b] 15 kinds of vanilla toilet and urinal become seats you can use, broken ones included. Men can use the urinals.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/kitchens.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]World kitchens.[/b] 355 dead stoves prep food like AN76's Prep Stove, and 42 espresso machines brew its Silt Bean coffee. This part needs only AN76, not its Bathroom Needs.[/center]

[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-an76-toilets@bdcf28fefa651496dfe0702f174e22a36326cf61/docs/img/leftovers.jpg[/img][/center]
[center][b]Leftovers.[/b] Accidents leave evidence: AN76's pile, a wet stain that fades, puke. A toilet that won't flush gets a pile and sometimes a burnt magazine. All of it cleans itself up.[/center]

[size=5][b][color=#12a3b4]Everything else[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Accidents replace AN76's pain. One switch in MCM brings the pain back.[/*]
[*]A HUD icon (made with HUDFramework) joins the status-icon row: yellow, orange, red.[/*]
[*]The aftermath: a lingering stink, gnats and aftershock farts. Nearby people gag or throw up.[/*]
[*]A clothes safety net: anything AN76's undress leaves off is put back on when you are done.[/*]
[*]Once per save, after you leave Vault 111, it starts AN76, its needs, Bathroom Needs and camping if they are not running. Anything you turn off in AN76's MCM afterwards stays off.[/*]
[*]Calmer needs, also once per save: hungry after 10 game hours (AN76: 6), thirsty after 7 (AN76: 4), the bathroom need 1 to 5 hours after a meal (AN76: up to 3). Change them in AN76's MCM and that stays. Coffee keeps you awake 6 hours instead of AN76's fixed 2 (an MCM slider).[/*]
[*]An MCM page for every part, plus a Testing page.[/*]
[/list]
[size=5][b][color=#12a3b4]Requirements[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/58440]Advanced Needs 76[/url][/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/20309]HUDFramework[/url][/*]
[*]F4SE[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fallout4/mods/21497]Mod Configuration Menu[/url] (for the settings)[/*]
[/list]Fallout 4 1.10.163, Next-Gen or the Anniversary Edition. Install with Vortex or MO2: the installer checks your setup first. Installing by hand is not supported.

[size=5][b][color=#12a3b4]Good to know[/color][/b][/size]
[list]
[*]People undress to go: vanilla underwear, or nude if you use a body mod. Toilet humour, nothing sexual.[/*]
[*]Underground Hideout's toilet covers its whole bathroom, so that bathroom does not work. We don't patch other mods.[/*]
[*]A toilet another mod hides by shrinking it is skipped.[/*]
[/list]
[size=5][b][color=#12a3b4]Credits[/color][/b][/size]
Advanced Needs 76 and its author, for the needs this builds on. Licence: PolyForm Noncommercial.
